_pdbx_database_remark.text   
;SHEET
THE TWO MOLECULES ARE ASSOCIATED VIA 1) AN INTERMOLECULAR
ANTI-PARALLEL BETA SHEET ASSOCIATION AROUND THE TWO-FOLD
NON-CRYSTALLOGRAPHIC AXIS AND 2) VIA INTERLEAVING OF
FINGERS TWO AND THREE WITH MUTUAL TRP-29/PHE-32 STACKING.
;
